            "sub_title": "The Artists Behind the Apron",
            "about": {
                "title": "Our Story: A Passion for Pastry and the Pursuit of Perfection",
                "status": true,
                "futures": [
                    {
                        "icon": "/images/theme/fashion_one/service.png",
                        "title": "Freshly Baked",
                        "description": "Ovens running 24/7"
                    },
                    {
                        "icon": "/images/theme/fashion_one/caller.png",
                        "title": "Custom Events",
                        "description": "Catering for Weddings & Parties"
                    },
                    {
                        "icon": "/images/theme/fashion_one/offer.png",
                        "title": "Seasonal Menu",
                        "description": "New Flavors Every Month"
                    }
                ],
                "description": "At our bakery, baking is more than just a daily routine—it is a vocation born from a love of simple, honest ingredients. We started with a singular mission: to bring the authentic taste of artisanal patisserie to our local neighborhood. Every day, our ovens warm up before the sun rises, filling the streets with the comforting aroma of toasted flour, melting butter, and fresh vanilla.\n\nOn the other hand, we strictly refuse to cut corners. We dislike the modern trend of mass-produced, artificial sweets that lack soul. We are so captivated by the charm of traditional techniques—like our 24-hour slow-fermented doughs and hand-laminated croissants—that we cannot imagine baking any other way. Equal praise belongs to our dedicated team who fail to compromise on quality, ensuring that every item is a masterpiece of flavor.\n\nIn our kitchen, when the timer dings and the trays emerge golden-brown, we know we have done our job right. We believe that true flavor requires patience and passion. We invite you to step inside, take a break from the busy world, and taste the difference that handmade care makes.",
                "content_bg_image_url": "/images/placeholder/about-us/about_banner.png",
                "content_left_image_url": null,
                "content_right_image_url": null
            },
            "testimonial": {
